1. Address to a Child. 2. Goodness of Providence. 3. The Vine. 4. The Orphan. 5. Elizabeth Loveless. 6. Little Susan and her Lamb. 7. Wonderful cure of Naaman. 8. Happy Cottager. 9. Mary Jones. 10. Ann Walsh, the Irish Girl. 11. Sally of the Sunday-School. 12. Destructive consequences of Vice, Dissipation, &c. 13. Mischief its own Punishment. 14. Louisa and the Little Birds. 15. Advice to Sunday S. Children. 16. Bread the Staff of Life. 17. Affectionate Daughter. 18. Happy Negro. 19. S. Butler, & Passionate Boy.
